        <profile name="Protocol Optimisation" id="a197-6eaa-e546-9e33" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">Once per turn, after any of your KASTELLAN ROBOT units within 2” of this unit are Activated or finishes an Advance within 2” of this unit, you may have that unit ‘change protocol’. If you do, until the next time this unit is Activated or dies, that unit gains the following abilities: Fortified Aegis: If this unit has Aegis Protocol, for each ranged attack that targets this unit, reroll a failed Saving Throw for that attack. Accelerated Drives: If this unit has Conqueror Protocol, reroll Move Rolls made for this unit. Targeting Matrix: If this unit has Protector Protocol, for each attack this unit makes, add 1 to the Hit Roll for that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
