      <profiles>
        <profile name="Repulsor Grid" id="17c1-05da-5ea4-0bcc" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">For each ranged or melee attack that targets this unit, a Saving Throw of 6 causes that attack to be&apos;reflected&apos;. After the current step, for each attack which reflected this step, the unit which made that attack suffers SW equal to its D.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Kastelan Protocols" id="b5ed-445b-1a2d-73e3" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit Deploys or an ability has this unit ‘change protocol’, select one of the following abilities. Then, this unit gains the selected ability and loses any of the other abilities (if it has any):

Aegis Protocol: For each ranged attack that targets this unit, reroll a failed Saving Throw of 1 for that attack.

Conqueror Protocol: You may reroll Move Rolls made for this unit.

Protector Protocol: For each attack this unit makes, add 1 to the Hit Roll for that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="Kastelan Robot" id="5bdb-093f-96b9-03fc" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
