      <profiles>
        <profile name="Cyborg Watchtower" id="82dc-802f-b423-8a8f" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After a Move Roll made for this unit during its Move step, you may discard the highest result of that Move Roll. If you do, until the end of the battle round, this unit gains the following ability:


Achillan Eye: After any enemy unit’s Move step, this unit may make attacks targeting that unit (if able) and for each of those attacks, reroll a Wound Roll of 1 for that attack. Then, it loses this ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Perfectly Engineered" id="efa1-275a-d97a-b551" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit&apos;s End step, if this was your first turn in a row, you must take another turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Stilt Legs" id="47d0-3799-c22c-20a8" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">This unit always has High Ground.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
