          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">For each attack made for this unit which targets an enemy unit within 4&quot; of this unit, that attack gains Critical Hits 6+.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Thermal Strafe" id="9bef-3c4f-1c3e-b459" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit&apos;s Attacks step, it may Reposition. If it does, if an enemy unit died this turn, you add 1 D6 to the Move Roll for that Reposition.</characteristic>
