        <profile name="Reflexive Vectoring" id="6058-5b20-64c9-180a" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After any enemy unit&apos;s Move step, as a reaction, if that enemy unit is within 24&quot; of and visible to this unit, roll a D6. On a 5+, this unit may Reposition. If this unit has High Ground, add 1 D6 to the Move Roll for that Reposition.</characteristic>
